# QA M6 regression (was qa_m6_bug_ampel1_stuck_red_camera_raised; fixed by
# D-102, E42): Ampel #1 must run its cycle while Resi stands on the
# Gastgarten terrace with the camera raised. qa_m6_strobl_relaxed's inputs
# (walking, Zuckerschock) to the terrace: she lands on it (2680, camera y
# 92), hops for the Oblaten over it (row 11; the camera rises to 48) and
# stands on its right part (2752, x 2448, centre right of col 152, within
# 12 tiles of the spawner): the camera rests at y 57, so the spawner cell
# (row 14, y 224-240) ends 3 px below the screen. The bug: the light was
# not "fully on screen" (D-093's cell test), stayed red while she watched,
# and its first car hit her once the camera dropped back as she walked off
# into the lane. Since D-102 the on-screen test is the lamp housing (y
# 192-220 here, on screen): the counter starts at 2732, the two cars
# (2762, 2802) drive beneath her, and after 230 frames of watching she
# walks off the terrace's right end in the red phase, past the mouth.
# Re-cut for D-102 (E42): she now stops at x 2624 (RIGHT released at
# 3096), short of the Selfie-Tourist who walks towards the mouth (the old
# inputs never got that far).
# Expected (game-design Stage 7 section 4): no Hurt, still big, x >= 2620.
